  unitName: "Deemo and the Girl (6\u2605)"
  unitId: 50565
  unitNumber: 1170
  description: An amnesiac girl from the foreign land of Grand Gaia and Deemo, the
    strange being that saved her. The girl and Deemo took off from Grand Gaia and
    eventually landed in Ishgria. There, they were sponsored by a certain demon patron
    who helped them set up a live performance. However, many of the demons who heard
    their music cast it aside as something for the weak. Though some say that other
    demons were moved by Deemo and the Girl's songs, inspiring them to place value
    in things other than battle.
  summonDesc: We've made it somewhere new again.<br>Deemo, let's share our music<br>with
    everyone here too!
  fusionDesc: This technique makes me feel warm...<br>I feel a gentleness from it.<br>It's
    like Deemo's music.
  evoDesc: Can you see it?<br>The new form attached to my ideals.<br>This is but
    a part of it.
  element: 5
  rarity: 5
